  "badges": [
    {
      "type": "origins:tooltip",
      "sprite": "origins:textures/gui/community/silent/badge/shapes/shape_heart.png",
      "text": "§e§lDamage Resistances:§r§f All sources (-25%).\n \n§c§lDamage Vulnerabilities:§r§f None.\n \n§e§lEffect Immunities:§r§f None."
    }
  ],
  "name": "Passive Features",
  "description": "§e§lStats:§r\n+20% Size\n+20% Melee Damage\n \n§e§lFeatures:§r\n- You can sense wounded creatures within 16 blocks: orange when more than half their health is missing, and red when more than three-quarters is missing. Undetectable creatures are excluded.\n- You see 75% better in darkness than most creatures.\n- Melee attacks inflict Poison I for 10 seconds.\n- Fire extinguishes after no more than 3 fire-damage ticks.\n- Killing a creature with a melee attack restores 2 Hunger and 2 Saturation.\n- While §c§l[Wet]§r or in cramped spaces, you lose your melee damage bonus and suffer -20% movement speed. Each second spent Wet adds 1 second to the lingering penalty, up to 2 minutes; the timer counts back down once you are dry. Cramped-space weakness ends when you have room again.\n- Food is 50% less effective, and you are a Carnivore.\n \n§e§lAdrenaline:§r Once every 3 minutes, lethal damage is prevented and you gain an additional 20% damage resistance for 35 seconds.",
